## Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) for local `wrangler dev`.
## Wrangler loads .dev.vars automatically; it is never committed.
## Real deploys set this via `wrangler secret put JWT_SECRET` instead.

JWT_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-string-for-local-dev

## Google OAuth (backend/src/auth/oauthGoogle.ts) — non-functional as
## placeholders. Register a real OAuth client at
## https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials (Web application type),
## add "<OAUTH_REDIRECT_BASE_URL>/auth/oauth/google/callback" as an
## authorized redirect URI, then replace CLIENT_ID/CLIENT_SECRET below for
## local dev — real deploys set CLIENT_SECRET via
## `wrangler secret put GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET` instead.
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=replace-with-a-real-google-oauth-client-id
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=replace-with-a-real-google-oauth-client-secret
OAUTH_REDIRECT_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8787
OAUTH_FRONTEND_REDIRECT_URL=http://localhost:3000/oauth/callback
